<title>USA: Giant Group, Horizon terminate agreement.</title>
<headline>Giant Group, Horizon terminate agreement.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giant Group Ltd, Horizon Fabrics Inc and Hirschberg Schutz &amp; Co Inc said they have decided it would be in their mutual best interests not to proceed with the proposed acquisition by GIANT of Horizon and Hirschberg at this time.</p>
<p>They said the decision was based on tax implications and other integration considerations.</p>
</text>
